From 5a6c8868fe27f53285a50da1560beeca1a37b033 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Trevor Wong <149596139+TronJuan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:23:38 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Personal add-ons: email agents, job search, theme

- Event Mate and inbox triage: flags important email and deadlines, turns
  event emails into scored events.
- Daily job search: scores postings for fit against a profile and drafts a
  tailored resume and cover letter for the best matches. Nothing is submitted.
- Overview, Emails, Events and Jobs pages.
- Settings: Email accounts (connect Gmail with an app password, no terminal),
  Personal agents (profile, resumes, searches, event preferences, Run now),
  and a theme (accent colour, background image).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
